:: MP Keepsake Use Whistle 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨雾翻涌的雾角灯塔外栈桥尽头，<<else>>海风浩荡的雾角灯塔外栈桥尽头，<</if>>你取出守塔人铜哨，对准悬在防波石梁下的古引航铜钟内壁簧口，旁边石座上嵌着一具黄铜量潮尺。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_foghorn_whistle"]>>铜哨尾端的双锚纹在海雾中泛着沉稳光泽。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks5_whistle"]>><span class="teal">借着先前用测风标校准过的哨音朝向，你一眼看准了古引航钟下方的共振簧口。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs6_whistle is 1>>
外栈桥尽头的古引航铜钟今日已借守塔人铜哨激振完毕，海面波平浪静。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-6">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "吹响铜哨 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-6">>
<<if (($swimmingskill or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_whistle'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_whistle to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_whistle_rew")>><<money 460>>铜钟内壁的暗屉随嗡鸣声弹开，吐出一卷早年灯塔长老预留的海事抚恤银币。<<else>>浑厚钟声与铜哨清音交织，顺着海雾传向远海航道。<</if>><span class="green">守塔人铜哨成功激发了外栈桥古引航钟的暗格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	浪头拍击石梁的轰鸣打乱了哨音节拍，簧片未能完全共振。<span class="red">你扶住石梁缓了口气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回回音廊 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拨动潮尺 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-6">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_whistle'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_whistle to 1>><<swimmingskill 2>><<gswimming>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_whistle_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>量潮尺底座滑出一枚刻着四季潮汐密度的古董铜筹，你将这件航海珍品贴身收妥。<<else>>量潮尺游标稳稳停在安全刻度，近海暗流走向一目了然。<</if>><span class="green">你凭铜哨回声与量潮尺摸清了雾角外海的暗流脉络。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	量潮尺滑槽沾着潮湿海盐，推拨游标时略显涩滞。<span class="red">你用袖口擦净滑槽盐粒。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角栈桥 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Core 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>子夜的机括城齿轮回廊尽头校准台前，<<else>>蒸汽微温的机括城齿轮回廊尽头校准台前，<</if>>你取出蓝钢怀表芯，贴近黄铜万年历副盘的擒纵同步槽，台面一角放着一把精密油石刀。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_clockwork_core"]>>蓝钢怀表芯在掌心发出平稳清脆的滴答声。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks5_core"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前用校音铜叉对准过的声学振频，你一眼找出了万年历副盘的同步插槽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs6_core is 1>>
齿轮回廊尽头的黄铜万年历副盘今日已借怀表芯同步完毕，运转无声。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-core-6">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "嵌入表芯 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-6">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_core'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_core to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_core_rew")>><<money 460>>万年历副盘三圈齐转，底座滑出一盒早年大工匠封存的精密铸币局银币。<<else>>蓝钢游丝带动万年历齿轮平稳啮合，走时分毫不差。<</if>><span class="green">蓝钢怀表芯唤醒了齿轮回廊尽头的万年历副盘。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回天文台 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	同步槽内侧的止动簧片微紧，嵌入表芯时差了半扣。<span class="red">你托稳表芯退后半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回密库 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "磨顺卡齿 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-6">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_core'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_core to 1>><<science 2>><<gscience>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_core_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>卡齿毛刺尽去，副盘暗匣弹出一枚镌刻着初代机括铭文的黄铜星轮，你将其收入怀中。<<else>>油石刀修整过的卡齿顺滑无比，怀表芯共鸣声愈发清亮。<</if>><span class="green">你用油石修整法彻底解开了万年历副盘的暗匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	油石刀刃口沾了一滴冷凝油，推磨时滑开了少许。<span class="red">你拿绒布擦净油石刀面。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回齿轮回廊 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Ring 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声隐约传入的沉没修道院抄经阁内席，<<else>>檀香幽静的沉没修道院抄经阁首席木案前，<</if>>你取出银鸽指环，对准胡桃木抄经台侧面的橄榄枝铜印槽，案头摆着一盒朱砂印泥与象牙刮刀。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_abbey_ring"]>>指环上的银鸽羽翼在烛光下泛着柔和白芒。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks5_ring"]>><span class="teal">借着先前用净水拭亮戒面时看清的内圈微雕，你一眼认出了抄经台暗锁的合印方向。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs6_ring is 1>>
首席抄经台的橄榄枝铜印槽今日已借银鸽指环核验完毕，木案整洁。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-6">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "扣入指环 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-6">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_ring'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_ring to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_ring_rew")>><<money 460>>抄经台夹层暗屉应声滑出，里面码放着一袋早年修道院译经院长封存的润笔银币。<<else>>银鸽与橄榄枝铜槽严丝合缝，木案下传来平和的机括轻响。<</if>><span class="green">银鸽指环成功开启了首席抄经台的夹层暗屉。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回静默石阶 (0:08)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜印槽边角残留着干涸蜡屑，扣入指环时偏了一线。<span class="red">你用指尖挑去残蜡定下神。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回藏经阁 (0:08)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "调匀印泥 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-6">>
<<if (($english or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_ring'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_ring to 1>><<history 2>><<ghistory>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_ring_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>朱砂合印落于羊皮卷首，暗格底板翻开，露出一枚古修会秘传的银质书签古玩，你将其妥善收起。<<else>>朱砂印迹鲜亮端庄，与抄经阁的古卷相得益彰。<</if>><span class="green">你以古修会合印礼唤醒了抄经台底部的秘藏。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	朱砂印泥受潮略稠，刮刀涂抹时不够匀净。<span class="red">你借烛火微温软化印泥。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回藏经阁 (0:08)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Amber 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜色静谧的秘密温室雾化兰花厅深处，<<else>>水雾轻拢的秘密温室雾化兰花厅深处，<</if>>你取出琥珀香膏瓶，嵌入琉璃温控香炉座的中心凹槽，座旁摆着一柄银质挑香针与水晶滴管。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_glasshouse_amber"]>>琥珀香膏瓶内的银脉兰标本在暖气中透出温润翠光。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks5_amber"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前在聚光台上用薄雾试出的七彩折光角，你一眼看准了温控香炉座的卡槽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs6_amber is 1>>
雾化兰花厅的琉璃温控香炉座今日已借琥珀香膏瓶熏染完毕，幽香扑鼻。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-6">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "嵌入炉座 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-6">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_amber'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_amber to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_amber_rew")>><<money 460>>温热气流激发琥珀奇香，琉璃座底格滑开，露出一袋植物沙龙名流预留的品鉴赏银。<<else>>琥珀香膏瓶与琉璃座严丝合缝，满室兰草在暖香中生机盎然。<</if>><span class="green">琥珀香膏瓶成功开启了琉璃温控炉座的底格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回兰花厅 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	琉璃炉座边缘沾着水珠，嵌入香膏瓶时指尖微滑。<span class="red">你拿软绒布拭干座口水珠。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回标本廊 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "挑取香脂 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-6">>
<<if (($housekeeping or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_amber'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_amber to 1>><<tending 2>><<gtending>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_amber_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>你将提纯出的银脉兰凝香收入水晶小瓶，获得了一份可随时提神安魂的珍稀草药精粹。<<else>>银针挑香手法轻巧细腻，香膏瓶封口完好如初。<</if>><span class="green">你借琉璃炉座温热提炼出了纯正的银脉兰香粹。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	银质挑香针尖端尚凉，香脂刚触针尖便凝成了小珠。<span class="red">你将银针在温水汽里烘暖。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回标本廊 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Medal 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨点砸落声中的黑铁货运站备用机车棚内，<<else>>余温未散的黑铁货运站备用机车棚内，<</if>>你取出站长纪念铜章，对准老式重型蒸汽机车驾驶室内的黄铜联锁盘，盘侧挂着一只长嘴注油壶。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_blackiron_medal"]>>站长纪念铜章上的机车浮雕在灯影下棱角铮亮。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks5_medal"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前用重型铜扳手联动装甲车阀箱的手感，你一眼认出了蒸汽机车头联锁盘的母口。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs6_medal is 1>>
备用机车驾驶室的黄铜联锁盘今日已借站长纪念铜章核验完毕，仪表归零。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-6">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "按入铜章 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-6">>
<<if (($physique or 10000) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_medal'] ? 600 : 0)) gte 11600 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_medal to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_medal_rew")>><<money 460>>联锁盘下的司炉长暗格弹开，露出一袋老铁路人封存的专线押运预备银币。<<else>>铜章纹路与联锁盘严丝合缝，蒸汽压力表发出清脆回响。<</if>><span class="green">站长纪念铜章打开了重型机车驾驶室的司炉暗格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回机车侧线 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
	联锁盘表面蒙着一层干煤灰，按入铜章时未能到底。<span class="red">你用棉纱擦去盘面煤灰。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回走私月台 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "润透联锁 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-6">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_medal'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_medal to 1>><<skulduggery 2>><<gskulduggery>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_medal_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>联锁销无声滑开，暗匣里弹出一枚罕见的初代铁路纯铜路签古件，你将其妥善收入囊中。<<else>>机油润透后的联锁销顺滑无比，整座驾驶室的机括运转自如。<</if>><span class="green">你借注油联动法完整取出了机车暗匣里的初代路签。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
	长嘴注油壶倾斜略急，机油滴在了铜章边缘。<span class="red">你用干麻布擦净指尖油迹。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回走私月台 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Antler 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>星光映照的深林古石环月泉祭坛北畔，<<else>>林雾清幽的深林古石环月泉祭坛北畔，<</if>>你取出白鹿角坠饰，对准月泉出水口上方那块刻着鹿角枝纹的青石闸板，旁边放着一只盛着松针露的木瓢。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_druid_antler"]>>白鹿角坠饰在林间光影下透出温润的象牙光泽。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks5_antler"]>><span class="teal">顺着先前青铜风铃与白鹿角共鸣出的音律，你一眼认出了月泉石台侧面的分叉印槽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs6_antler is 1>>
月泉祭坛北畔的青石闸板今日已借白鹿角坠饰开启过，泉水清澈见底。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-6">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "嵌入闸槽 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-6">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_antler'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_antler to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_antler_rew")>><<money 460>>青石闸板轻响移开，水龛干槽里露出一袋早年巡林长老封存的护林古银币。<<else>>白鹿角与青石枝纹严丝合缝，月泉水流发出清脆悦耳的叮咚声。<</if>><span class="green">白鹿角坠饰成功唤醒了月泉北畔的水龛暗格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回石柱群 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	青石闸槽边沾着湿滑水苔，嵌入坠饰时指尖滑了半寸。<span class="red">你用干松针擦去槽边水苔。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回古根地穴 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "淋洗鹿角 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-6">>
<<if (($willpower or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_antler'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 440 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_antler to 1>><<tending 2>><<gtending>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_antler_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>清泉涌起托出几株罕见的月泉银叶草，你将这味珍贵林间草药采入药袋贴身收好。<<else>>松针清露顺着白鹿角流入泉眼，整座祭坛弥漫着沁人心脾的草木清香。<</if>><span class="green">你借松针清露与白鹿角引出了月泉深处的灵草。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木瓢边缘沾着露水，倾倒时水线偏了一寸。<span class="red">你双手托稳木瓢定下心神。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回月泉祭坛 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Mask 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜宴正酣的天鹅绒暗层假面回廊尽头，<<else>>烛影摇曳的天鹅绒暗层假面回廊尽头，<</if>>你取出纯银狐面胸针，对准六折苏绣屏风底座的暗银狐首扣，旁边矮几上摆着一柄鹅毛扇与金粉盒。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_velvet_mask"]>>纯银狐面胸针眼窝里的红宝石在暗光下流转着殷红微芒。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks5_mask"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前借香薰炉暖烟看清的红宝石折光码，你一眼找准了丝绒屏风底座的狐首锁孔。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs6_mask is 1>>
六折苏绣屏风底座的狐首暗扣今日已借胸针开启过，回廊内暗香浮动。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-6">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "按入胸针 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-6">>
<<if (($seductionskill or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_mask'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_mask to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_mask_rew")>><<money 480>>屏风底座暗格悄然滑开，露出一叠名流私宴预留的不记名礼金银票。<<else>>银狐胸针与屏风底座严丝合缝，屏风后的私密花厅一览无余。<</if>><span class="green">纯银狐面胸针成功打开了假面回廊屏风的暗格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	屏风底座包角略滑，按入胸针时银针偏了半毫。<span class="red">你扶稳屏风边框定下神。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回观海露台 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拂开金粉 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-6">>
<<if (($danceskill or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_mask'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_mask to 1>><<seductionskill 2>><<gseduction>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_mask_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>金粉在红宝石光下显出暗门铭文，屏风夹层弹出一枚嵌宝古董袖扣，你将其妥善收进贴身绒袋。<<else>>鹅毛扇轻摇间金粉簌簌落定，尽显从容优雅的沙龙风度。<</if>><span class="green">你借金粉显影法参透了纯银狐面胸针的隐藏铭文。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	鹅毛扇挥动稍急，金粉散在了矮几绒布上。<span class="red">你放缓手腕重新拢起金粉。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回拍卖暗厅 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Lens 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜空澄明的旧天文翼楼星图档案室深处，<<else>>光线柔和的旧天文翼楼星图档案室深处，<</if>>你取出消色差古透镜，对准黄铜星谱折光仪的副镜筒卡口，案旁摆着一册古星云图谱与绒面擦镜布。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_observatory_lens"]>>消色差古透镜的双层镜片在灯下泛着澄澈幽光。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks5_lens"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前用象牙微调尺量定的视差数据，你一眼看准了折光仪副筒的卡口焦距。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs6_lens is 1>>
星图档案室的黄铜星谱折光仪今日已借古透镜校焦完毕，星芒清晰。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-6">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "旋入副筒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-6">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_lens'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_lens to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_lens_rew")>><<money 480>>焦距合拢瞬间，折光仪底座弹出一卷早年天文学会封存的观测津贴银币。<<else>>消色差古透镜消除了一切色散，投映出的星谱条纹纤毫毕现。<</if>><span class="green">消色差古透镜成功开启了星谱折光仪的底座暗格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回星图室 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	副镜筒卡口的铜簧片略紧，旋入时偏了半圈。<span class="red">你双手托稳镜圈退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拭镜对图 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-6">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks5_lens'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs6_lens to 1>><<science 2>><<gscience>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks6_lens_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>星谱焦点指向图谱夹层，你从中取出一枚镌刻着黄道十二宫的古董铜星盘留作收藏。<<else>>镜片纤尘不染，古星云图谱上的暗星坐标尽数映入眼帘。<</if>><span class="green">你借消色差古透镜破译了古星云图谱的夹层秘藏。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	档案室窗缝吹进一缕微风，翻动了图谱书页。<span class="red">你伸手按住图谱页角。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
